msgstr "README"

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:1
msgid "triorb_safe_run_cpp"
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:3
msgid ""
"C++ implementation of TriOrb's safe run-velocity filter node. The node "
"synchronizes SICK point cloud streams, builds a lightweight occupancy map, "
"and publishes safer `/drive/run_vel` commands derived from "
"`/safe_drive/run_vel` by means of a potential-field based repulsive force "
"model."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:5
msgid ""
"Prefix depends on `ROS_PREFIX` env var (same mechanic as Python版) to allow "
"namespace scoping."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:7
msgid "Repository layout"
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:8
msgid "`include/triorb_safe_run_cpp/` – public headers (`safe_run_node.hpp`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:9
msgid "`src/` – node implementation (`safe_run_node.cpp`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:10
msgid ""
"`config/` – sample parameter files (copy `sample_config.json` and adjust per"
" robot)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:11
msgid "`launch/` – placeholder for future launch files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:13
msgid "Key features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:14
msgid ""
"ApproximateTime synchronized `sensor_msgs::msg::PointCloud` subscribers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:15
msgid "Occupancy map persistence with optional decay (`map_decay`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:16
msgid ""
"Angle-weighted potential forces with velocity bias (`velocity_bias`) to keep"
" repulsion even when vehicle speeds are low."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:17
msgid ""
"Safety controller that blends filtered velocity commands and republishes "
"`/drive/run_vel`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:18
msgid "Optional debug compressed image publisher (`enable_image_pub`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:20
msgid "Building"
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:26
msgid "Running"
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:31
msgid "Common parameters (see `config/sample_config.json` for full list):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:32
msgid "`point2d_topics`: array of SICK point cloud topics."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:33
msgid ""
"`point2d_topics_csv`: same as上記だがカンマ区切り文字列で指定したいときに使用 "
"(`topic_a,topic_b,...`)。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:34
msgid ""
"`anker_points`: footprint vertices used for potential anchor calculations "
"(mm units)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:35
msgid "`anker_points_csv`: `x0,y0,x1,y1,...` 形式でアンカーポイントを一括指定。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:36
msgid ""
"`slowdown_gain`, `slowdown_gamma`, `slowdown_focus`: "
"減速挙動を決める集約パラメータ（詳細は`config/sample_config.json`参照）。実機走行でのチューニングが必要。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:37
msgid "`map_decay`: 0.0–1.0 blend factor to retain past obstacles."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:38
msgid ""
"`ctrl_ms`, `vel_filter_weight`: control loop cadence and "
"smoothing（`vel_filter_weight`は実機での振る舞いに合わせてチューニングが必要）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:40
msgid "Notes / Best practices"
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:41
msgid ""
"Ensure all `point2d_topics` publishers are available before launching; the "
"node waits but exits if none are provided in the config."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:42
msgid ""
"Disable `map_decay` (set to 0) if you require instantaneous obstacle "
"clearing; otherwise a small decay (e.g., 0.4) stabilizes noisy scans."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:43
msgid ""
"減速関連は "
"`slowdown_gain`（強さ+減衰）、`slowdown_gamma`（距離依存）、`slowdown_focus`（角度と横移動のバランス）の3つだけを調整すると元の挙動に近いまま簡潔にチューニングできます。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:44
msgid ""
"When tuning, start with `velocity_bias = 0.0` and increase only if you need "
"residual repulsion when nearly stopped."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:45
msgid ""
"For visualization, set `enable_image_pub=true` and inspect "
"`/triorb_safe_run/debug/image/compressed`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../packages/triorb_safe_run_cpp/standard_docs/original/README.md:47
msgid ""
"Contributions: please keep the README/Agent files updated as parameters or "
"behavior change."
msgstr ""
